{
  "file" : "npc/pre-re/guides/guides_niflheim.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "You must be lost..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Why would anyone come"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "to this horrid, dreadful"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "place on purpose...??"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Ever since I stumbled fell down into this giant tree, I've suffered endlessly here. I've wasted years in sadness, being unable to escape Niflheim."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "But in searching for an"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "escape route, I probably know"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "this town better than anyone"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "else. I guess knowing the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "layout might help you escape"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "if it weren't so futile."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Ask building locations."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Remove marks on the mini-map."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Cancel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "So, um, which place do you want to know about?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Witch's castle"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Tool shop"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Weapon shop"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Pub"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "There. I made a ^FF3355+^000000 mark"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "on your mini-map so that you can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "go to the castle where that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "creepy witch lives."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "I went there once, but then I"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "ran away and decided that I"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "should try to not die as much"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "as possible. That's pretty"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "much my life goal here in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Niflheim."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "The Tool shop is located"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "at the ^CE6300+^000000 mark I made"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "on your mini-map."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "They sell some unique items that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "you cannot find outside of this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "town. Of course, they weren't so"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "special once I realized no"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Potion can ease the pain I feel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "...I wish I was in prison."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "The Weapon shop is located"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "at the ^55FF33+^000000 mark I made"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "on your mini-map."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "They sell some unique items which"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "you cannot find outside of this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "town... Of course, fighting"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "the monsters here will just"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "make them angrier. You may as"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "well let them eat you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "The Pub is located at"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "the ^3355FF+^000000 mark I've made"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "on your mini-map."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Sometimes I see dead people in the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Pub enjoying themselves, having a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "good time. I used to be able to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "have fun once, but now all I feel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "is the cold tingle of loneliness"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "and despair...every waking moment."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "If you want to remove the location"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "marks from your mini-map, please"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "choose 'Remove marks on the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "mini-map' from the menu."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "I removed the location marks from"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "your mini-map. Go ahead and ask"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "me if you want to mark the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "building locations again. It"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "helps me ignore the depression"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "that gnaws at me constantly."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "[Ricael]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "It's not a good idea to search"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "Niflheim by yourself..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Roaming Man",
      "text" : "At least try to be careful."
    }
  ]
